00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.970
This story is fiction...

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.970
but in 10 years, who knows?

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:21.230
OH MY GOD!!!
My gun misfired, misfired, MISFIRED!!!

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:24.690
You dummy! That's what you get for
using a loaded gun like a samurai sword!

00:24:24.690 --> 00:24:28.480
For one thing, the TV crew was standing
right at my feet, secondly I was blinded...

00:24:28.480 --> 00:24:31.190
by that light burst, and THEN the blast
knocked my on my butt. I'm in trouble!!

00:24:31.190 --> 00:24:33.490
What?! Are you OK??
Where were you hurt?

00:24:33.700 --> 00:24:35.570
Don't worry about me! I'm tough!
Justice must prevail!!

